app.log	1
app.log	2
-- a hard link is not read
app.log	3
-- a write through the other name is read under the read name
app.log	4
-- the read name is removed and the other name is linked again: read on, not from the start
new.log	5
-- the same name is linked again
new.log	6
-- link and unlink: the only other name reads on
next.log	7
-- a hard link renamed into the directory is not read
next.log	8
-- the read name is replaced by another file: the other name reads on, the new file is read from the start
keep.log	10
next.log	9
-- a hard link made while the table is detached
keep.log	11
-- hard links that exist when the table is created
a.log	1
a.log	2
-- a symbolic link is not read, and is not read either once it dangles
a.log	1
a.log	2
